                                                "sense_id": "77995b30-ab39-359b-84c7-6651cee1e642",
                                                "text": "He scored ten birdies during the tournament."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4ca43f46-0597-4530-95ff-c2de16bd92f4",
                                                "sense_id": "77995b30-ab39-359b-84c7-6651cee1e642",
                                                "text": "The heat brought one blessing. It baked the 7,053-yard par 35-35—70 course to concrete hardness and gave some added roll to the drives. Birdie, which have been at a premium, came easier."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
